WEBVTT

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:26.190
It has been over fifty years since mankind ventured into outer space in order to avoid extinction.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.760
Over the years, they encountered numerous other species

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:32.110
and had begun to establish 
a large interstellar civilization.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:37.800
However, there are still many unknown threats lurking in outer space.

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:37.790
2067 AD

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:47.790
Var Syndrome.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:53.480
It suddenly destabilizes people's minds and reduces them to a violent mob.

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:59.580
People grew to fear these tragic events, which could happen anywhere and anytime.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:05.830
However, amongst the fear, some rose up valiantly to fight back.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:10.960
Walkure, a tactical sound unit.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:14.360
They sing with their trans-dimensional voices

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:18.120
under the protection of the Delta Platoon.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:22.850
Today, the curtain rises for their next stage.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:36.860
Did you find her?

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:37.610
No.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:39.100
Damn that stowaway.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:40.670
Where the hell did she go?

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:47.620
Planet Al Shahal

00:01:57.490 --> 00:01:58.640
Hayate!

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.380
Hayate Immelmann.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:02.170
Come to the office immediately.

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:05.640
Aye, aye.

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:07.140
Here.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.490
Here's your last paycheck.

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:10.650
Am I fired?

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.010
Of course you are.

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:14.640
You slack off when it's sunny to bathe under the sun,

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.860
and you slack off when it's raining because it makes you feel blue.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:15.990
Cheapskate.

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:21.700
There was a stowaway.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.180
With the Var riots, the time
for peace is long gone.

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:27.790
Anyway, it's your last day, 
so don't end it on a bad note.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:28.880
Shame.

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:30.290
You got jobs done when you weren't lazy.

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:35.300
<i>Hello?</i>

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.510
Don't end it on a bad note, huh?

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:40.650
<i>Hello!</i>

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.520
<i>Hip and hop as the clock ticks and tocks{chikkuchikku na chokuchoku}</i>

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.410
<i>Restlessly flutter around like a butterfly{zowazowa hirari howahowa}</i>

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:55.440
<i>Don't stare at me so impatiently{jirijiri to jirojiro to kocchi minaide}</i>

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.810
Watch out, dude!

00:02:55.440 --> 00:03:01.150
<i>I'm so tired, glittering with— can't say what, eek!{betobeto dashi giragira ienai no yo hiyahiya}</i>

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.790
He's dancing.

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:08.010
<i>Huh? Huh? Something's wrong... My heart's out of control{un? un? okashii na? hato no seigyo fukanou ni}</i>

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:03.410
Don't break the cargo!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.500
<i>Thimpety thump, it won't stop{dokidokidoki dokudoku to konya watashi wa iranai}</i>

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.500
The sound is dancing.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.250
<i>Can I stay tonight?{konya watashi wa iranai}</i>

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.250
It's blue? White?

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:16.500
No, this sound...

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:20.010
<i>Feelings rolling, my pride tries to brake but I can't stop now{kokoro korokoro tokutoku uso da tomarenai}</i>

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.230
is the color of the wind!

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:23.220
<i>I'm so awkward when I'm around you{aimai aimai me and you}</i>

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:26.100
<i>I feel like I'm some bugged robot{kore wa gatagata gosadou}</i>

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:28.950
<i>Please just ignore me, this doesn't count{sou yo kaunto shinaide}</i>

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:29.990
<i>Don't—{jirijiri—}</i>

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:37.690
I'm sorry!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.570
Could you let me go?

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:40.510
What?

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.780
So she's the stowaway?

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.950
Here, hop off.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:48.470
You're letting me go?

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:50.040
I figure you have your reasons.

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:53.750
Thank you so much!

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:57.280
But yeah, I definitely do.

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:59.890
The mayor told me, "You're already 
fourteen. Stop wasting your life away."

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:03.530
"Go get married to the apple farm heir."

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:06.280
I told him no, and he said no.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:08.830
So I took the chance and snuck on a ship,

00:04:08.830 --> 00:04:12.060
but my butt hurt and using the restroom was hard.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:14.330
Oh, I forgot to introduce myself.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:17.270
My name is Freyja Wion.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:22.320
I am truly... truly...

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:25.160
hungry...

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:27.120
Uh...

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:36.170
This is amazing after being on an apple diet!

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:40.120
So you snuck on a ship just because you didn't want to get married?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.130
That's not all!

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:45.380
Look!

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:52.920
Is this the song that helps neutralize the Var?

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:53.560
Yeah!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.150
It's Walkure's latest song!

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:57.260
"Love! Halation THE WAR."

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.190
And?

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:05.820
They have an audition for a new member on Planet Ragna next week!

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.630
And you want to apply?

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:08.680
Indeed!

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:11.290
This isn't Ragna, by the way.

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:13.850
This is Al Shahal.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:16.210
Ragna is 30 light years next door.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.720
I've made a terrible mistake!

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.560
Tough luck.

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:27.470
I guess it's time to give up.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:28.720
Here, have another.

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:32.290
No, I won't give up!

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.520
I'm going to get to Ragna

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:38.180
and join Walkure!

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:40.360
What's your motivation?

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.150
Do you have to ask?

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.360
Because I love Walkure!

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:49.570
I love to sing!

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:56.500
When I'm singing, I feel alive.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.920
It makes my Rune all shiny and glittery!

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:02.640
That's dumb.

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:04.550
You're not gonna make the cut.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.050
I will!

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:07.960
I can fly if I ride the wind.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:11.180
Don't you have something that's special to you?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:12.410
Nope.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:15.040
No hobbies? No girlfriend?

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:15.890
Nope.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:19.060
That sounds like a fun life.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.610
Who asked you—

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:25.820
There she is!

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:28.210
Oh!

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:30.550
Thanks for the rice balls!

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:31.370
Stop!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:32.690
No chance!

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:38.040
What a weirdo.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:40.290
Welcome to Al Shahal.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:46.090
The direct bus to Shahal City leaves from terminals three through eight.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:46.090
Situation normal.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.840
Makina and Reina, how is it going?

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.300
This is Makimaki.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.420
Nothing special at Shahal City.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:59.480
Those are Regult 104s.

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:01.440
How cute!

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:03.510
This is Reina.

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:05.900
Nothing from the compound sensors.

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:09.810
I'm gonna start making spicy miso jellyfish potstickers at my eatery.

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:10.550
Would you like—

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:11.410
No.

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.700
I prefer my jellyfish raw.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.120
Swallow it whole.

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:17.480
Don't fool around on a mission, Chuck.

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:18.570
Yes, sir!

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:21.500
But you sure there's gonna be a Var here?

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:26.810
There have been ten cases of Var Syndrome in the past month.

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:30.220
Three of which had abnormalities in their biological fold waves.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:35.070
We detected an abnormality near Shahal City fifteen hours ago.

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:39.810
And our order from Lady M is to find out what's responsible for that.

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:42.140
So, Mikumo.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:44.460
How's our naive little girl doing?

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:46.250
I don't know.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:49.850
I can't go undercover with her around.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:52.470
Mikumo, please answer!

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:53.610
Mikumo!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:56.880
Goodness.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:58.160
She always does this.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.140
Fuck her.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.880
"That sounds like a fun life."

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.940
What's the commotion?

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.120
They found the stowaway.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:09.500
What an idiot.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.640
Surrender and go back to where you're from.

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.730
I refuse!

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:19.050
If I try, I can fly.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:28.520
Hop on!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:29.960
You again.

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:31.490
Okay!

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:32.550
Fuck!

00:08:32.550 --> 00:08:33.900
Don't let them get away!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.240
Ahhhhh!

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:39.140
What was that?

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.830
Which planet are you from?

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.470
I know someone on a transport ship, so why don't you just—

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.630
I'm not going home!

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.300
Are you gonna fly to Ragna?

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:49.280
I will.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:50.790
I can fly if I ride the wind.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:53.070
If I risk my life, I can fly.

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.980
Risk your life?

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:57.550
This audition isn't worth your life.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:58.300
It is!

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.220
Why do you keep implying the audition is stupid?

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:04.810
Because I don't have anything special.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:09.320
I've been to a lot of places and tried a lot of things,

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:10.900
but nothing felt right.

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:15.540
I thought I could find something somewhere too.

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:16.440
But...

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.030
Well, I'm not surprised!

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:21.210
You can't just go <i>somewhere</i>.

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:23.250
You have to go somewhere you want to go!

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:34.090
I want to sing songs I love!

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.990
For as long as I possibly can!

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:40.140
So I'm not going home!

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.290
Ow...

00:09:58.910 --> 00:09:59.960
Freeze!

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:05.550
You pervert!

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:07.410
I caught the stowaway!

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.750
Stop! You got the wrong person!

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.750
I can arrest you for sexual harassment!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:12.240
Hello!

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:14.210
I'm the stowaway!

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:16.540
Oh?

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.340
I'm sorry.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:23.780
Say, you don't work for the airport.

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:24.960
Who are you?

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:31.040
Third Fleet of Chaos Ragna, Delta Platoon

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:33.110
Second Lieutenant Mirage Farina Jenius.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.110
Delta Platoon?!

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:36.960
Please send any complaints to my—

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:41.280
By Delta Platoon, do you mean the one that flies with Walkure?

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.280
Y-Yes.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:46.140
This is wonderful!

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:48.310
What's going on?

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:50.670
She's apparently your fan.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:52.540
Fan?

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.380
That's right!

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.760
10th Marine Assault Battalion, 
commence flight to Al Shahal.

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:01.210
My output isn't consistent. Can you take a look?

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:03.540
Okay, in that case...

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:15.230
A song?

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:27.950
We're detecting abnormalities in biological fold waves!

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.900
Why are there so many at once?

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:33.020
That's a Zentradi base too.

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:35.840
Well, this couldn't get any worse.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:38.340
Var alert has been issued.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:39.350
Roger!

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:40.090
I'm on my way.

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:43.130
Please go find a shelter.

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.110
What is it?

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:44.970
What's happening?

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.920
There's a Var outbreak.

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:50.640
This is going to turn into a battlefield.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.330
Battlefield?

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.400
This is a warning!

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.530
Go back to your base!

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:05.090
If you refuse—

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:07.840
It's no use!

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.830
They've all been taken over!

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:28.060
What's wrong?

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:30.390
I hear a rainbow colored voice.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.730
There's finally some action.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:46.240
<i>Welcome to Walkure World</i>

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:44.860
Here we go!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.170
It's show time!

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.580
Music is magic!

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:59.120
<i>Welcome to Walkure World</i>

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:56.440
I knew it!

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.610
It's Mikumo!

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:06.170
<i>Welcome!</i>

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:12.890
<i>My Heart... feel your Love.</i>

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:15.060
Music is love!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:20.450
<i>Welcome to Walkure World.</i>

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:20.020
Music is hope!

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:24.700
Music is life!

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:29.280
Lend an ear to the songs of a goddess!

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:33.120
Super Dimension Venus, Walkure!

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:39.420
It's Walkure!

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:46.880
<i>Switch into gear! Screaming! No stopping now{nobosete screaming mou tomarenai no}</i>

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:50.260
<i>S.O.S. the sirens are howling{S.O.S  agaru sairen}</i>

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.600
<i>Love's halation THE WAR{koi hareishon the war}</i>

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:58.620
<i>My own story begins as I wake up{mezamereba ugokidasu monogatari}</i>

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:58.180
Wow!

00:13:58.180 --> 00:13:59.690
This is so cool!

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:05.110
<i>This morning feels different, I rub my eyes{itsumo to nanka chigau asa mabuta kosutta}</i>

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.130
<i>Ready to fire! Three, two{hassha chokuzen three two}</i>

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:10.340
<i>onepiece flying as I spin{onepiece wo hirugaeshitara}</i>

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:14.370
<i>My engine is now in extreme speed{minagiru ya baisoku engine}</i>

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:18.620
<i>Then we crash and a galactic level{butsukatte gingakyuu}</i>

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.900
<i>Boom comes for your deculture!{dokyu to bukkomi dekarucha}</i>

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:26.380
<i>All power starboard! I'm setting you on fire{omokaji zenkai hi wo tsukeru wa}</i>

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:32.100
<i>Feel it? Diving! There's no turning back{kanjite diving mou modorenai no}</i>

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:35.550
<i>S.O.S. the signal's on fire{S.O.S  moeru shigunaru}</i>

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:38.770
<i>Love's changing THE WORLD{koi changing the world}</i>

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:37.020
Wow!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.770
Amazing!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.690
<i>Love! Love! Melody of Love...</i>

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.820
<i>Love! Love! Melody of Love...</i>

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:51.450
<i>Love! Love! Melody of Love...</i>

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:56.220
<i>The glitter of the stars whispers to me{hoshitachi no matataki ga sasayaku wa}</i>

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:56.420
One of them is off.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:15:02.050
<i>I hear their voices saying "feel your love"</i>

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:07.570
<i>My days used to be a boring repeat, but now they shine{kurikaeshi datta nichijou ga ima mabushikutte}</i>

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:11.770
<i>and make me beautiful{watashi wo kirei ni shiteiku}</i>

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.090
Mikumo!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.100
You're fucking kidding.

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:16.010
<i>The chances are galactic{kakuritsu wa gingakyuu}</i>

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:18.850
<i>and there goes your deculture{kimi ga bukkomu dekarucha}</i>

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:23.570
<i>All power port side! I've set you on fire{torikaji ippai hi ga tsuita wa}</i>

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:25.190
Deculture.

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:29.330
<i>Switch into gear! Screaming! No stopping now{nobosete screaming mou tomarenai no}</i>

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:31.980
<i>S.O.S. is echoing around{S.O.S  hibiite}</i>

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:35.990
<i>Love's halation THE WAR{koi ga halation the war}</i>

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.860
<i>For sure, now, there's more{kitto saa motto}</i>

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.530
Walkure!

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:41.390
<i>More, now, hold me tight{motto saa gyutto}</i>

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:41.120
They neutralized the Var with music.

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:44.130
<i>Hold me tight, hey, gently{gyutto nee sotto}</i>

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:44.130
Activate hold receptor.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:51.130
<i>See? Close and tight, we share the pain{hora ne motto gutto kimi ni sasare}</i>

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.370
Okay!

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:50.790
The song's working!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.950
Several unknowns detected in Area 108.

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:09.050
All units, prepare to engage!

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:11.150
I repeat! All units, prepare to engage!

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.290
They're preparing to engage.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:14.570
Engage in T minus 300 seconds.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:17.080
Aerial Knights, prepare to engage.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:22.790
Ride the wind, my aerial knights!

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:25.480
For the great wind.

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:27.170
For the great wind!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:30.050
Let me show you guys how it's done!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.850
Three down.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:41.890
Enemy below at nine o'clock.

00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:46.720
Don't drop your guard, Bogue.

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:48.720
Master Herman!

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:50.620
Don't call me master.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:51.740
Yes, sir!

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:03.250
Unknown approaching fast!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:05.410
Seal the launch gate immediately!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:16.050
Major Arad, unknown units have 
destroyed the Al Shahal garrison fleet.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.570
They're headed your way.

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:18.680
Unknown units?

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.390
New enemies?

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.860
Consider them hostile.

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:29.320
All weapons free.

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:31.110
Formation Hermes!

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:31.710
Roger!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:32.610
Aye, sir!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.570
You're mine!

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:40.740
What's this jamming?

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:42.770
It split?!

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:44.040
Take this!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:45.710
Mirage!

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:46.620
Chuck!

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:50.570
Leave it to the great Chuck!

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:53.460
Submarine attack!

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.140
Come and get me...

00:17:58.140 --> 00:17:59.760
Got him!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:00.430
Too easy.

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:04.350
Now, Messer!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.320
Roger!

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:07.920
This wind...

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.100
They're good.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:11.440
Take this!

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:13.780
Three! Two! One!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.210
He dodged them?!

00:18:25.260 --> 00:18:26.350
Calm down.

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:27.140
Lord Keith!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.080
He's fast.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:37.420
A death reaper?

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:44.470
This flight pattern is...

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:46.020
Leader, they're headed your way.

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:47.980
Everyone, be on guard!

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:57.360
Go to hell, Walkure!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:07.370
Mikumo!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:08.590
Mikumo?

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.120
The Var is coming back.

00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:13.130
Reirei!

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.180
Walkure...

00:19:27.940 --> 00:19:29.700
You've done it now.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:41.310
<i>I fell in love when I saw his eyes{mitsumeatte koi wo shite}</i>

00:19:41.310 --> 00:19:44.200
<i>There was nothing but him on my mind{muga muchuu de oikakete}</i>

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.680
Makina...

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:50.020
<i>With burning passion I tried to know him more{dakedo motto shiritakute meramera shiteru}</i>

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:46.660
Reirei!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.080
Let's sing.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.290
Yeah!

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:53.170
<i>But the more I sought him the deeper the maze{negau hodo nazo wa fue}</i>

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.960
<i>and with every moment my heart blazed hotter{omou hodo netsu ni naru}</i>

00:19:55.960 --> 00:20:02.910
<i>So I kept diving into new and unknown frontiers{dakara motto tobikomu no mikai no sekai}</i>

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:58.160
Are they crazy?

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:08.650
<i>Everyone believes in love and dreams{koi toka yume toka dare demo shinjiru kedo}</i>

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:04.300
No...

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.180
No...!

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:07.250
This feels amazing...

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.690
I can't hold it in.

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:15.310
<i>but it's no fun without raising the stakes{sokosoko semenakya tsumannai yo}</i>

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:10.310
Lulu...

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.310
Lulu...

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:15.310
Lu lala!

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:20.330
<i>Eyes on the edge, on the forbidden borderline{girigiri eye ikenai borderline}</i>

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:19.400
Time to show some Winderemere power!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:21.110
She's a Windermeran?

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:26.990
<i>I'll break all limits, no matter how tough{nanido g demo subete kowashite miseru}</i>

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:26.990
She's risking her life?

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:32.460
<i>Mind on the edge, seeking another limit to break{girigiri mind saranaru g he to}</i>

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.120
What's that voice?

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.160
It came to my chest.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:33.040
An active reaction?

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:38.550
<i>My conscience fades and my body doesn't listen{ishiki wa tokeru karada wa seigyofunou}</i>

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.620
There's someone else!

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:42.550
<i>I'm coming{icchau kamo ne}</i>

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:41.730
That's nuts!

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:42.790
Take them outta here quickly!

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:45.390
Release the security so it can be moved easily!

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:51.610
It's essentially the same.

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:57.020
<i>We screwed around as friends{fuzakeatta tomodachi to}</i>

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.900
<i>We sought each other as something more{motomeatta ano hito to}</i>

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:05.330
<i>I'm always prepared, hoping we'll meet again{mata aeru hi no tame ni giragira shiteru}</i>

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:08.950
<i>The brighter the light, the darker the shadow{hikaru hodo kage wa deki}</i>

00:21:08.950 --> 00:21:11.740
<i>The higher the blaze, the taller the pile of ash{moeru hodo high ni naru}</i>

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:18.420
<i>The farther I run, the more I see that dangerous line{hashiru hodo mietekuru abunai line}</i>

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:16.500
You okay? We're running!

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:24.420
<i>You can get peace and freedom if you want them{jiyuu mo heiwa mo nozomeba umareru kedo}</i>

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:26.240
Captain! Active reaction detected at three o'clock!

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:30.830
<i>They'll grow mold if you don't take care of them{motamota shitetara kusacchau yo}</i>

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:27.180
What?

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:29.970
He's dancing?

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:36.140
<i>Eyes on the edge, a dangerous border race{girigiri eye abunai border race}</i>

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:42.650
<i>We must be nuts, accelerating still{hijoushiki dane mada kasoku shiteiru yo}</i>

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:47.910
<i>Mind on the edge, at the boiling point{girigiri mind genkaiten nara}</i>

00:21:46.390 --> 00:21:47.910
I feel the rhythm!

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:50.160
<i>You can paint me your color{nurikaete ii}</i>

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:51.990
It's the color of wind again!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:57.420
<i>Destruction and rebirth is my life{hakai to saisei kara watashi wa dekiru}</i>

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:16.300
We're flying!

00:22:17.130 --> 00:22:22.020
<i>Eyes on the edge, on the forbidden borderline{girigiri eye ikenai borderline}</i>

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:29.030
<i>I'll break all limits, no matter how tough{nanido g demo subete kowashite miseru}</i>

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:34.160
<i>Mind on the edge, seeking another limit to break{girigiri mind saranaru g he to}</i>

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:33.540
What's this?

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:40.170
<i>My conscience fades and my body doesn't listen{ishiki wa tokeru karada wa seigyofunou}</i>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:36.040
This song...

00:22:40.170 --> 00:22:43.040
<i>I'm coming{icchau kamo ne}</i>

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:43.040
is wind?!

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:48.680
<i>Eyes on the edge, on the forbidden borderline{girigiri eye ikenai borderline}</i>

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:55.530
<i>I'll shine bright even as my flame burns out{moetsuki nagara mada kagayaite miseru}</i>

00:22:54.950 --> 00:22:56.810
Mission 01: Prologue on the Battlefield

00:22:55.530 --> 00:23:00.770
<i>Mind on the edge, struggling for you{girigiri mind anata no tame ni}</i>

00:23:00.770 --> 00:23:07.410
<i>and for the future, not fearing the fall{mirai no tame ni nando kudakechitte mo}</i>

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:18.500
<i>It is love that brings me back to life{ai suru koto de umarekawaru}</i>

00:23:20.140 --> 00:23:31.890
<i>It is love that I need, coming back to you{ai saretakute ikite kaeru}</i>

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:40.020
Next time: Ready for the Audition
